msgid "Django Deprecation Timeline"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This document outlines when various pieces of Django will be removed or "
"altered in a backward incompatible way, following their deprecation, as per "
"the :ref:`deprecation policy <internal-release-deprecation-policy>`. More "
"details about each item can often be found in the release notes of two "
"versions prior."
msgstr ""

msgid "7.0"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Django 6.0 release notes <deprecated-features-6.0>` for more "
"details on these changes."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``serialize`` keyword argument of "
"``BaseDatabaseCreation.create_test_db()`` will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.StringAgg`` class will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.mixins.OrderableAggMixin`` class "
"will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The default protocol in ``urlize`` and ``urlizetrunc`` template filters will "
"change from HTTP to HTTPS."
msgstr ""

msgid "The ``URLIZE_ASSUME_HTTPS`` transitional setting will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Using a percent sign in a column alias or annotation will raise "
"``ValueError``."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Support for setting the ``ADMINS`` or ``MANAGERS`` settings to a list of "
"(name, address) tuples will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``orphans`` argument being larger than or equal to the ``per_page`` "
"argument of ``django.core.paginator.Paginator`` and "
"``django.core.paginator.AsyncPaginator`` will no longer be allowed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The :mod:`django.core.mail` APIs will no longer accept certain parameters as "
"positional arguments. These must be passed as keyword arguments instead."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Support for passing Python's legacy email ``email.mime.base.MIMEBase`` "
"object to ``EmailMessage.attach()`` (or including one in the message's "
"``attachments`` list) will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid "The ``django.core.mail.BadHeaderError`` exception will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``django.core.mail.SafeMIMEText`` and ``SafeMIMEMultipart`` classes will "
"be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``django.core.mail.forbid_multi_line_headers()`` and "
"``django.core.mail.message.sanitize_address()`` functions will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid "6.1"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Django 5.2 release notes <deprecated-features-5.2>` for more "
"details on these changes."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``all`` keyword argument of "
"``django.contrib.staticfiles.finders.find()`` will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fallbacks to ``request.user`` and ``request.auser()`` when ``user`` is "
"``None`` in ``django.contrib.auth.login()`` and "
"``django.contrib.auth.alogin()``, respectively, will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``ordering`` keyword argument of the PostgreSQL specific aggregation "
"functions ``django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.ArrayAgg``, "
"``django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.JSONBAgg``, and "
"``django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.StringAgg`` will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Support for subclasses of ``RemoteUserMiddleware`` that override "
"``process_request()`` without overriding ``aprocess_request()`` will be "
"removed."
msgstr ""

msgid "6.0"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Django 5.0 release notes <deprecated-features-5.0>` for more "
"details on these changes."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``DjangoDivFormRenderer`` and ``Jinja2DivFormRenderer`` transitional "
"form renderers will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Support for passing positional arguments to ``BaseConstraint`` will be "
"removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"``request`` will be required in the signature of "
"``ModelAdmin.lookup_allowed()`` subclasses."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``django.db.models.sql.datastructures.Join`` will no longer fallback to "
"``get_joining_columns()``."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``get_joining_columns()`` method of ``ForeignObject`` and "
"``ForeignObjectRel`` will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``ForeignObject.get_reverse_joining_columns()`` method will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The default scheme for ``forms.URLField`` will change from ``\"http\"`` to "
"``\"https\"``."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Support for calling ``format_html()`` without passing args or kwargs will be "
"removed."
msgstr ""

msgid "Support for ``cx_Oracle`` will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid "``BaseDatabaseOperations.field_cast_sql()`` will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``ChoicesMeta`` alias to ``django.db.models.enums.ChoicesType`` will be "
"removed."
msgstr ""

msgid "The ``Prefetch.get_current_queryset()`` method will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``get_prefetch_queryset()`` method of related managers and descriptors "
"will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"``get_prefetcher()`` and ``prefetch_related_objects()`` will no longer "
"fallback to ``get_prefetch_queryset()``."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``FORMS_URLFIELD_ASSUME_HTTPS`` transitional setting will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Django 5.1 release notes <deprecated-features-5.1>` for more "
"details on these changes."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``ModelAdmin.log_deletion()`` and ``LogEntryManager.log_action()`` "
"methods will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The undocumented ``django.utils.itercompat.is_iterable()`` function and the "
"``django.utils.itercompat`` module will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``django.contrib.gis.geoip2.GeoIP2.coords()`` method will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid "The ``django.contrib.gis.geoip2.GeoIP2.open()`` method will be removed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Support for passing positional arguments to ``Model.save()`` and "
"``Model.asave()`` will be removed."
